<description>&lt;p&gt;The Colombian army sentenced five former soldiers to reparations work for executions, while a bomb hit a police patrol near a Carabineros school in Cali without causing injuries. A methane blast at a coal mine killed two workers and left two missing, and two separate bus accidents in southwestern Colombia and on a motorway killed eight and six people respectively, injuring many. Social leaders continue to be targeted, with more than 45 killed in the first 100 days of the current administration. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOSHRWZFlYTHE2emZpMzZpQVM4NzQ3S01IOF9veWpfbEZvc1dlWWtmYy1DTFlHM1B5WFR6dHJDeElOODczY2xmX1RBMGF2VVZTaXpTRXFubUJBWlhqTmxfelptTHpyTm9zQVZhbkNlOUYzenFpZHlFYldUSzA5eFZlekNGOU5GdTFaRDlSbUtOZzJoeW5pMlppUl9QN29lMU91ZFdBam5ZamxxNDB3NGl6eFd0XzVhRTZnazRXdTJDTDQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Diálogo Americas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNYnBTSXI0TTdHS1NZbWtZdi1pTzVYdF9wUjctcXNBbXRNTzhrYVk5U2xkN3ZQckwwNWpvNXk0MzViam9uZGdnUkxCUzkyTTBoQ3JSZ3RBcFk3S0h3Ym5XZWhvazh4UzI3QnJLSWJCVVU4WWUwcW9JdnhacUljR3ZheEZ5SktFWmN2YUUxWkVsQ0RQZkdsTU44TENnc3BIa2hyY1J3bHFqY2hLcGpQNkpPRmFzVHpZOEY0ME0wb2QtZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;CiberCuba&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNaXNsLTVsbnVYNlFBZ3pPTnJpZlpxVkc2bUU3MF8tc3JiTDhFTExDdmpkREpyVXNxUjlqaFpJYUprUkl0VklTWWNBZXVVdkZyZTZHWUE2Z3pSamhnTWRBVkxIcV9vOTItX3U5c1VaeDRFcGlhWWpBNjR0cE1sU2RMU0oxNGpNMXlVMllVY00wdmNtdmZISUFFa0V2dEVlN0RqekZKekMyNEFHeEVFMUZtclF2MGxaSkVXTFlkdA?oc=5&quot;&gt;teleSUR English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNRXBrYzRVVS1jUTNOS0xYSTF3anJPQmRfZ0tvT1lTOWlwZnczTDBaV084RUswdnNDNjd3TjhUZ3dwYVd6UnplZUk3TndPRGdYX21jalA3Y3UtOEFJb0xXSVRaNmRJS